OL,3,GNEWSALaw on 'holiday hunger' passed by
OL,4,AStormont assembly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA law aimed at helping lower income
OL,7,Ffamilies with food costs during school
OL,8,Fholidays has been passed by the
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland Assembly.
OL,11,FThe Holiday Meal Payments Bill seeks to
OL,12,Fcreate a new payment for families whose
OL,13,Fchildren receive free school meals to
OL,14,Fhelp with food costs outside of term
OL,15,Ftime.
OL,17,FA majority of 49 to 24 assembly members
OL,18,Fbacked the legislation, which was
OL,19,Fproposed by Sinn Fein's Danny Baker and
OL,20,Fwelcomed by some parents and charities.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
