OL,3,GNEWSALaw on 'holiday hunger' passed by
OL,4,AStormont assembly
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Minister Paul Givan described
OL,7,Fthe bill as "fiscally reckless",
OL,8,Fwarning it would cost #20m to #30m a
OL,9,Fyear and lead to cuts elsewhere within
OL,10,Fhis Stormont department.
